; Regression test for issue #3327: a lot bought and sold on the same day
; books no unrealized gain or loss.
;
; Prices are kept by the day, so both trades are valued at the day's last
; price, $12.00.  The 10 ABC bought at $10.00 are sold the same day, which
; realizes their $20 gain in Income:Gains and leaves nothing unrealized.

2024-01-02 Buy
    Assets:Broker    10 ABC @ $10.00
    Assets:Cash

2024-01-02 Sell
    Assets:Broker   -10 ABC {$10.00} @ $12.00
    Assets:Cash      $120.00
    Income:Gains

test bal -V --unrealized --now 2024/06/01
              $20.00  Assets:Cash
             $-20.00  Income:Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test
